WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.926
The core contribution is Carbon Monitor Ocean, or
CMO-NRT: a near-real-time, monthly,

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:11.650
gridded dataset of global surface ocean carbon
dioxide fugacity and air-sea flux,

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:16.101
together with the machine-learning framework that
generates it.

00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:19.563
Rather than replace the trusted community models,

00:00:19.643 --> 00:00:25.640
it updates all ten ocean biogeochemical models and
eight data products from the Global

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.244
Carbon Budget 2022 into a near-real-time framework.

00:00:29.324 --> 00:00:35.250
The dataset and the code are released openly, on
Figshare and on the project website.
